#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:385
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Ny Code Country Default dia ampiasaina handrafetana isa tsy misy tovana "
"iraisam-pirenena (oh : +358).\n"
"\n"
"Raha avela ho foana, ny rafitra dia manandrana mamantatra azy ho azy avy "
"amin'ny karatra SIM na tambajotrao.\n"
"\n"
"Azonao atao ny manafoana azy io eto amin'ny alàlan'ny fampidirana kaody "
"faritra ISO misy litera 2 (oh: US, FI, DE) na kaody fiantsoana (oh: +358, "
"358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:413
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic uses the limit reported by the phone's MMS service, which is right "
"for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your messages fail to send, or a "
"larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Mametra ny haben'ny hafatra multimedia ny mpandraharaha. Ny sary sy horonan-"
"tsary ampiarahinao dia aporitra ho azy mba ho latsaky io fetra io alohan'ny "
"andefasana.\n"
"\n"
"Ny Aotomatika dia mampiasa ny fetra ambaran'ny serivisy MMS an'ny telefaona, "
"izay mety amin'ny ankamaroan'ny mpandraharaha. Misafidiana sanda kely kokoa "
"raha tsy lasa ny hafatrao, na lehibe kokoa raha fantatrao fa mamela izany ny "
"mpandraharahanao."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:435
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Ny feon'ny ringback dia ny feo alefa (toot-toot-toot) eo am-piandrasana ny "
"fiantsoana hivoaka. Ny mpitatitra sasany dia tsy mamokatra izany ka manana "
"safidy hamoaka azy amin'ny tanana izahay eto. \n"
"\n"
"Azonao atao ny misafidy ny rakitra mozika anao manokana, na mamafa azy io "
"mba hampiasana ny feon'ny rafitra mahazatra."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Safidio ny Ringback Tone"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:463
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Audio Files"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Safidio ny boky adiresy hampiasaina amin'ny Telephony ary alamino araka ny "
"laharam-pahamehana. Ny bokim-adiresy ambony indrindra no manana ny laharam-"
"pahamehana ambony indrindra ary tiana kokoa raha misy laharana hita ao "
"amin'ny bokim-adiresy maro. Azonao atao ny mampiasa ny toggle Duplicate "
"Resolver etsy ambany mba hanampiana amin'ny fitantanana ireo dika mitovy, fa "
"na dia kilemaina aza, dia mamporisika azy io izahay mba hahazoana traikefa "
"tsara kokoa."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:508
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Rehefa alefa, raha miantso anao in-3 ao anatin'ny 5 minitra ilay laharan-"
"telefaona mitovy, ny antso fahatelo (sy ireo manaraka eo amin'ny "
"varavarankely) dia hanery ny telefaona haneno amin'ny haavony ambony "
"indrindra, handalo ny maody Mangina na Aza manelingelina."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:520
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Mifidiana fifandraisana izay handefa fampandrenesana amin'ny feo feno foana, "
"na dia amin'ny fomba Mangina na Aza manelingelina ny telefaona."

