#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Ity no hamafin'ny feon'antso ho an'ny fivoahana tsirairay. Ampiharina ho azy "
"io haavo io rehefa mifandray ny antso ary isaky ny miova ny fivoahana "
"mandritra ny antso, ary re avy hatrany ny fanovana ny slider. Ny fitaovana "
"dia mampihatra ny haavo amin'ny dingana vaventy, ary ny fihainoana an-"
"tsofina tsy mangina tanteraka mihitsy. Ny haavon'ny Bluetooth dia voatahiry "
"ho an'ny fanohanana fandefasana ho avy."

